  "prefLabel": "Nur 101.13 Medication skills instructor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 101.13 “Medication skills instructor” means a registered nurse approved by the board to teach in a medication administration education program meeting the requirements of Nur 900.\n\nSource. #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13 (from Nur 101.13); #ss by 10569, eff 4-17-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Nur 100); renumbered by #13672 (formerly Nur 101.14)",
